# SysEdit: the Window menu (Tile, Cascade, Arrange Icons, the four children, the active one checked),
# Window > Tile (WM_MDITILE: a 2 x 2 grid, column by column from the top of the z-order), then
# Window > Cascade (WM_MDICASCADE: back to the cascade positions)
# reference: scn/mdi-tile.scn (frames 02-04)
# regress: sh apps/sysedit/tests/sysedit.sh "$TEST" "$OUT"
# compare: mdi-tile/02.png 02.png active ignore 316 228 333 261
# compare: mdi-tile/03.png 03.png active ignore 310 228 333 261
# compare: mdi-tile/04.png 04.png active ignore 316 228 333 261
sleep 500
key alt
key w
sleep 300
shot shots/02.png
key t
sleep 300
shot shots/03.png
key alt
key w
key c
sleep 300
shotcaret shots/04.png
quit
